VoiceManager - VoxLock pre-filter

__init__.py in this directory is adapted from voxlock 1.3.0 by Arbaz Siddiqui
(https://github.com/arbazsiddiqui/voxlock, voxlock/core.py), which is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that licence is in the LICENSE
file next to this notice.

The streaming overlap-add, the window, the output gain and the ONNX session
inputs are taken from voxlock/core.py. They were modified for VoiceManager: only
the fp32 models are used, the sessions run on the CUDA provider only, and the
download code, file mode, live mode, CLI and precision choices were left out.

The model files are not part of VoiceManager. They are downloaded from
https://huggingface.co/arbazsiddiqui/voxlock at revision
2413b292bc2c337bfc19a9802aaf3e011e68e9c4 by `python setup_models.py tyger`.

